# An HTTP request a server handler receives: the method, the full target, its parsed path and query, the headers, and the
# body text. The handler routes on `method` / `path` and reads the payload with `read`.

form request
  link method, like text
  link url, like text
  link path, like text
  link query, like text
  link headers
    like hash
      like text
      like text
  link body, like text
  link dock, mark private

# the request body as text
task read
  take request, like request
  like text
  send back
    read request/body
